cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the associated data, please cite the Zenodo record (DOI to be minted)."
title: "Rainfall event detection pipeline and validation suite for the CMORPH 2000-2025 global rainfall event catalogue"
abstract: >-
  Detection code, validation scripts and documentation for a 26-year (2000-2025)
  global rainfall event catalogue derived from CMORPH V1.0 ADJ at 8 km / 30 min
  resolution. The catalogue contains 9,409,781 events and carries a documented
  four-era non-homogeneity partition that constrains how the record may be used.
  This archive contains code and documentation only; the catalogue itself is
  deposited separately under CC-BY-4.0.
type: software
